<!-- /wp:media-text -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"align":"center"} -->
<p class="has-text-align-center">&nbsp;</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"align":"center"} -->
<p class="has-text-align-center">Contact us at&nbsp;<a href="mailto:communityeducation@swic.edu">communityeducation@swic.edu</a> for details.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<div id="register" style="margin-top: -225px; padding-top: 225px; z-index: -99;"> </div>
<table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-style: solid;" border="1">
<tbody>
<tr style="height: 287px;">
<td style="width: 100%; height: 286px;">
<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center">Community Education Registration Instructions</h2>
<p><strong>STEP 1: Create a Community Education account by visiting the link below :</strong></p>
<div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="https://estorm.swic.edu/psp/estorm/EMPLOYEE/SW_HC9_PRD/c/SW_COMMUNITY_ED_MENU.SW_CSA_LNDNG_PG.GBL?" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Register</a></div>
<p>You will be prompted to sign in or create a community ed account.</p>
<p><strong>STEP 2:</strong> <strong>Once your account is created, click “Browse Classes”</strong><br />Make sure you are <strong>SIGNED IN.</strong> If you are not signed in it will prompt you to create another account for registration.</p>
<p><strong>STEP 3:</strong> Scroll down to click<strong> Computer Classes or click “New Community Ed Workshops”.</strong></p>
<p><strong>STEP 4:</strong> A list of available classes will pop up.  Add the desired registration to your cart.  Check the location before adding the class to your cart.</p>
<p><strong>STEP 5:</strong> <strong>Scroll Up</strong> to the top of your page and Click <strong>“Proceed to Shopping Cart”</strong></p>
<p><strong>STEP 6:</strong> Click <strong>Checkout Now</strong>, then <strong>Click Checkout and Proceed to Payment</strong>, <strong style="text-decoration: underline;">even if the class is free.</strong></p>
<p class="has-text-align-center"><em>You will receive confirmation that has your continuing ed ID  and contact information. You will not be prompted to pay for a free class</em></p>
<p class="has-text-align-center"><strong><em>If you miss the registration window, reach out to me by email @ </em></strong><a href="mailto:stefani.pittman@swic.edu"><strong><em>stefani.pittman@swic.edu</em></strong></a><strong><em> and I can add you to the class there if there is space available. </em></strong></p>
<p class="has-text-align-center"><strong><em><u>If an instructor does not show up within the first 15 minutes of class, send an email to </u></em></strong><a href="mailto:stefani.pittman@swic.edu"><strong><em>stefani.pittman@swic.edu,</em></strong></a><strong><em> and sign in on the sign–in sheet for the class. I will follow up within 24 hours at the very latest.</em></strong></p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p></p>
